(7722086, 1271095, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting and compelling landscape.  I''ll bite.</td>', 'Interesting and compelling landscape.  I''ll bite.', '2022-06-24 00:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7722091, 1271101, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow look at you two personal bests in the space of one week, absolutely brilliant. So happy for you.<br/> <br/><i><b> <br/></b></i>I gotta stop traveling with non-photographers. They don''t even understand the whole get-up-early thing either.<br/> <br/>TOO FUNNY!! I know exactly what you mean!<br/> <br/>Sometimes my best images are shot out of a car, I say sometimes.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow look at you two personal bests in the space of one week, absolutely brilliant. So happy for you.  I gotta stop traveling with non-photographers. They don''t even understand the whole get-up-early thing either. TOO FUNNY!! I know exactly what you mean! Sometimes my best images are shot out of a car, I say sometimes. ', '2022-06-24 01:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
