(7722107, 1271101, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congratulations on the blue and another one knocking your middleton doll further down the page .. altho i must say when i was pretty new on dpc that doll blew me away .. its still one of my favs too .. <br/>anyway back to this wonderful win for you and such an incredible shot .. <br/>the fact that it was taken from a moving car just goes to show if you are a great photographer difficult conditions wont stop you .. and i''m just thinking ..  if you werent in that moving car you may not have got this magic shot .. !! .. <br/>often things that arent planned work out better anyway .. <br/>but i''ve gotta say .. you need to train your friends .. if you show them this they may take your photographic needs into account on your next sojourn  .. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'many congratulations on the blue and another one knocking your middleton doll further down the page .. altho i must say when i was pretty new on dpc that doll blew me away .. its still one of my favs too .. anyway back to this wonderful win for you and such an incredible shot .. the fact that it was taken from a moving car just goes to show if you are a great photographer difficult conditions wont stop you .. and i''m just thinking ..  if you werent in that moving car you may not have got this magic shot .. !! .. often things that arent planned work out better anyway .. but i''ve gotta say .. you need to train your friends .. if you show them this they may take your photographic needs into account on your next sojourn  .. :) ', '2022-06-24 02:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
