(7722110, 1270869, 97225, '<td valign="top">If I''d been handing out the ribbons you would have got a yellow one. I love this and I love your title, too.</td>', 'If I''d been handing out the ribbons you would have got a yellow one. I love this and I love your title, too.', '2022-06-24 03:04:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7722111, 1271101, 24454, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours.  I was hoping so because I knew it would win!<br/> <br/>I too laughed at the non-photographer thing!  I wonder how many more good photos I might have if my hubby had been willing to stop for me or not get impatient once we did stop.  <br/> <br/>It sure didnt hurt you here tho!  Mega Congratulations!</td>', 'I thought this might be yours.  I was hoping so because I knew it would win! I too laughed at the non-photographer thing!  I wonder how many more good photos I might have if my hubby had been willing to stop for me or not get impatient once we did stop.   It sure didnt hurt you here tho!  Mega Congratulations!', '2022-06-24 03:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7722112, 1271064, 163081, '<td valign="top">Actually the white cloud abov&amp;#8310;e the mountains are not clouds but sulfer coming out of the many vents blowing white/ green clouds into the air. It''s not a pleasant smell in that area. Compare it to rotting egg mixed with stinky farts.   &amp;#128518;<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-06-24 02:29:53.</i></td>', 'Actually the white cloud abov&#8310;e the mountains are not clouds but sulfer coming out of the many vents blowing white/ green clouds into the air. It''s not a pleasant smell in that area. Compare it to rotting egg mixed with stinky farts.   &#128518;', '2022-06-24 03:27:40.000000', '2022-06-24 03:29:53.000000', 0),
